WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.112
If you work forty hours a week and there's little left at the end of the month, the problem isn't your effort.

2
00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:13.693
It's that you don't have a system.

3
00:00:13.693 --> 00:00:16.900
Give me a few minutes and I'll show you what we built to change that.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.650
Most people try to learn investing on their own.

5
00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:25.123
Random videos, tips from strangers, they open an account, lose money and give up.

6
00:00:25.123 --> 00:00:27.110
I know, because I've been there too.

7
00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.877
The problem was never willpower.

8
00:00:28.877 --> 00:00:32.080
It was having no method, no tools and nobody by your side.

9
00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:35.963
I'm Ricardo Garcia, and that's where MoreThanMoney came from.

10
00:00:35.963 --> 00:00:37.651
It's not a course you buy and forget.

11
00:00:37.651 --> 00:00:43.263
It's an ecosystem: you learn, you apply and you follow everything in one place, with a community that speaks your language.

12
00:00:44.363 --> 00:00:46.841
Freedom isn't quitting everything tomorrow.

13
00:00:46.841 --> 00:00:53.066
It's being able to choose: where you work, how much time you give your family, which places you want to see.

14
00:00:53.066 --> 00:00:54.680
That doesn't come from luck.

15
00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:58.600
It comes from learning to look after your money, one step at a time.

16
00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:02.265
You start by learning, and there are two pillars.

17
00:01:02.265 --> 00:01:04.568
The first is MTM Markets: markets and money.

18
00:01:04.568 --> 00:01:08.389
Academies for forex and metals, crypto, stocks and ETFs, and real estate.

19
00:01:08.389 --> 00:01:13.048
Live rooms every week, and recordings organised into a course for when you can't make it.

20
00:01:14.148 --> 00:01:18.907
The second is MTM Content and Business: building an audience and building a business.

21
00:01:18.907 --> 00:01:26.858
Social media and UGC, faceless marketing, artificial intelligence, network marketing, and mindset and leadership, which you can open for free.

22
00:01:26.858 --> 00:01:28.986
You start from zero, at your own pace.

23
00:01:30.086 --> 00:01:31.008
Then you apply.

24
00:01:31.008 --> 00:01:36.975
Our scanners, Gold Killer, Aurum Flow, TrendShot and MTM Scanner, are studies we wrote ourselves.

25
00:01:36.975 --> 00:01:42.266
They read the market and show you the trend, the zones and the risk before you get in.

26
00:01:42.266 --> 00:01:44.849
They run on your phone and on TradingView.

27
00:01:44.849 --> 00:01:48.110
You stop guessing and start working from a checklist.

28
00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:51.438
And all of this fits in your pocket.

29
00:01:51.438 --> 00:02:01.771
The MTM System app brings together the community feed, the chat, the live classes, alerts with entry, stop and targets, and the AI Mentor, who answers you at any hour.

30
00:02:01.771 --> 00:02:05.484
You get the alert, you see the chart, and you make the call.

31
00:02:06.584 --> 00:02:08.945
Alerts are the day-to-day of the house.

32
00:02:08.945 --> 00:02:14.576
Each one comes with the source, the pair, the direction, the entry, the stop and the targets.

33
00:02:14.576 --> 00:02:17.542
When price hits a target, you get a notification.

34
00:02:17.542 --> 00:02:20.206
When the stop moves up to entry, you do too.

35
00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:23.355
And everything stays in the history, in plain sight.

36
00:02:24.455 --> 00:02:26.365
And the tools don't stop there.

37
